From 2ab6a604507ee3b1de0169a4784dc8b0e9a2ff8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:13:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pass `ITestContext` to
 `AbstractTestNGCucumberTests.scenarios()` overrides

Cucumber-JVM 8.0.0 changed the TestNG `@DataProvider` from `scenarios()` to
`scenarios(ITestContext)`, so runners that override `scenarios()` to run in
parallel no longer override anything. Add the parameter and pass it to
`super.scenarios(...)`.

Part of #63
